`SQLFunctionExpression` is the analyzer's placeholder for a SQL UDF call before `ResolveSQLFunctions` inlines its body as `SQLScalarFunction`. The placeholder hard-codes `override def nullable: Boolean = true`, yet it reports `resolved = true` as soon as its inputs resolve (its `dataType` the user-declared `returnType`).

This leads to CTE that captures wrong nullability, e.g.
