{code:java}
TypeInformation<?> mapKeyTypeInfo =
    getTypeInfo(
            options,
            keyFormatOption,
            ...
    ){code}
we infer TypeInformation for state key instead of map key. Should be:
{code:java}
TypeInformation<?> mapKeyTypeInfo =
    getTypeInfo(
            options,
            mapKeyFormatOption, 
            ...
) {code}

